      "importance": 3,
      "label": "Sequential bottleneck",
      "label_en": "Sequential bottleneck",
      "label_zh": "序列计算瓶颈",
      "detail": "Recurrent sequence models process positions sequentially, which limits parallelization during training.",
      "detail_en": "Recurrent sequence models process positions sequentially, which limits parallelization during training.",
      "detail_zh": "循环序列模型按位置依次处理，限制训练时的并行化。",
      "section": "Introduction",
      "section_en": "Introduction",
      "section_zh": "引言",
      "quote": "The fundamental constraint of sequential computation, however, remains."
    },
    {
      "id": "attention_gap",
      "type": "related",
      "importance": 2,
      "label": "Attention before Transformer",
      "label_en": "Attention before Transformer",
      "label_zh": "Transformer 之前的注意力",
      "detail": "Attention can model dependencies over distance, but earlier systems usually combine it with recurrence.",
      "detail_en": "Attention can model dependencies over distance, but earlier systems usually combine it with recurrence.",
      "detail_zh": "注意力可以跨距离建模依赖，但早期系统通常仍与循环网络结合。",
      "section": "Background",
      "section_en": "Background",
      "section_zh": "背景"
    },
    {
      "id": "transformer",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 3,
      "label": "Transformer thesis",
      "label_en": "Transformer thesis",
      "label_zh": "Transformer 核心提案",
      "detail": "The Transformer removes recurrence and convolution and relies entirely on attention to draw global dependencies.",
      "detail_en": "The Transformer removes recurrence and convolution and relies entirely on attention to draw global dependencies.",
      "detail_zh": "Transformer 去掉循环和卷积，完全依靠注意力建立全局依赖。",
      "section": "Proposal",
      "section_en": "Proposal",
      "section_zh": "核心提案",
      "quote": "based solely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions entirely",
      "figure": "transformer_architecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "encoder",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 3,
      "label": "Encoder stack",
      "label_en": "Encoder stack",
      "label_zh": "编码器堆栈",
      "detail": "The encoder is a stack of N = 6 layers. Each layer combines multi-head self-attention, a feed-forward network, residual connections, and layer normalization.",
      "detail_en": "The encoder is a stack of N = 6 layers. Each layer combines multi-head self-attention, a feed-forward network, residual connections, and layer normalization.",
      "detail_zh": "编码器由 N = 6 层组成，每层包含多头自注意力、前馈网络、残差连接和层归一化。",
      "section": "Architecture",
      "section_en": "Architecture",
      "section_zh": "架构"
    },
    {
      "id": "decoder",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 3,
      "label": "Decoder stack",
      "label_en": "Decoder stack",
      "label_zh": "解码器堆栈",
      "detail": "The decoder is also a stack of N = 6 layers and adds encoder-decoder attention plus masking of future tokens.",
      "detail_en": "The decoder is also a stack of N = 6 layers and adds encoder-decoder attention plus masking of future tokens.",
      "detail_zh": "解码器同样由 N = 6 层组成，并加入编码器-解码器注意力和未来词元屏蔽。",
      "section": "Architecture",
      "section_en": "Architecture",
      "section_zh": "架构"
    },
    {
      "id": "scaled",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 3,
      "label": "Scaled dot-product",
      "label_en": "Scaled dot-product",
      "label_zh": "缩放点积注意力",
      "detail": "Queries and keys are compared by dot product, divided by the square root of dk, then passed through softmax to weight the values.",
      "detail_en": "Queries and keys are compared by dot product, divided by the square root of dk, then passed through softmax to weight the values.",
      "detail_zh": "查询和键先做点积，再除以 dk 的平方根并经过 softmax，用于加权求和值。",
      "section": "Attention",
      "section_en": "Attention",
      "section_zh": "注意力",
      "quote": "The output is computed as a weighted sum of the values.",
      "figure": "attention_mechanism"
    },
    {
      "id": "multihead",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 3,
      "label": "Multi-head attention",
      "label_en": "Multi-head attention",
      "label_zh": "多头注意力",
      "detail": "The model uses h = 8 parallel heads, each with dk = dv = 64. The heads attend to different representation subspaces and positions.",
      "detail_en": "The model uses h = 8 parallel heads, each with dk = dv = 64. The heads attend to different representation subspaces and positions.",
      "detail_zh": "模型使用 h = 8 个并行头，每个头的 dk = dv = 64，可关注不同表示子空间和位置。",
      "section": "Attention",
      "section_en": "Attention",
      "section_zh": "注意力"
    },
    {
      "id": "masking",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 2,
      "label": "Masked generation",
      "label_en": "Masked generation",
      "label_zh": "屏蔽式生成",
      "detail": "Decoder self-attention masks illegal future connections so each prediction only uses known output positions.",
      "detail_en": "Decoder self-attention masks illegal future connections so each prediction only uses known output positions.",
      "detail_zh": "解码器自注意力屏蔽未来连接，使每次预测只能使用已知输出位置。",
      "section": "Attention",
      "section_en": "Attention",
      "section_zh": "注意力"
    },
    {
      "id": "ffn",
      "type": "method",
      "importance": 2,
      "label": "Position-wise feed-forward",
      "label_en": "Position-wise feed-forward",
      "label_zh": "逐位置前馈网络",
      "detail": "Each layer applies two linear transformations with ReLU independently at every position. The inner dimension is dff = 2048 and the model dimension is dmodel = 512.",
      "detail_en": "Each layer applies two linear transformations with ReLU independently at every position. The inner dimension is dff = 2048 and the model dimension is dmodel = 512.",
      "detail_zh": "每层在每个位置独立执行两次线性变换和 ReLU；内部维度为 dff = 2048，模型维度为 dmodel = 512。",
      "section": "Architecture",
      "section_en": "Architecture",
      "section_zh": "架构"
    },
    {
